; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Core.c	   181     \REASON This function is called from Os_ErrKernelPanic() right after the panic hook has returned. As the panic hook
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Core.c	   182             is the last possible exit point for the tests, Os_Hal_CoreFreeze cannot be covered in tests. Because of the
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Core.c	   183             simplicity of the code, the performed code inspection results in sufficient quality.
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Core.c	   184  
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Core.c	   185  \ID COV_OS_HALCOREASSEMBLERINSTRUCTIONDATACASE
