; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Core.c	   193     \REASON This inline function is used within macros in the file "Os_Hal_Entry_Lcfg.c". The file is not analyzed in our
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Core.c	   194             testsuite. Nevertheless it is assured (by review of the assembler output) that the macro is used.
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Core.c	   195  
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Core.c	   196  Justifications for core:
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Core.c	   197  
